 high-resolution computed tomography of the chest be obtained?</article-title><source>Pediatrics</source><year>1998</year><volume>101</volume><fpage>1071</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9606238</pub-id></element-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>